{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"When the OTS proof is confirmed (not pending), the check passes even with `--max-pending-hours` set. This is correct behavior.\n\nNow let me also test the case where there's a pending OTS but the sigstore attestation is recent (within the threshold):","thinkingSignature":"[{\"type\":\"reasoning.text\",\"text\":\"When the OTS proof is confirmed (not pending), the check passes even with `--max-pending-hours` set. This is correct behavior.\\n\\nNow let me also test the case where there's a pending OTS but the sigstore attestation is recent (within the threshold):\",\"format\":\"unknown\",\"index\":0}]"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-e02ca347-f9b4-4ed9-8536-ba730bcf757d","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workspace/record && python3 -c \"\nimport tempfile, os, json, hashlib, time\nimport record as R\n\nd = tempfile.mkdtemp()\ntry:\n    os.makedirs(os.path.join(d, 'entries'))\n    os.makedirs(os.path.join(d, 'anchors'))\n    os.makedirs(os.path.join(d, 'inbox'))\n    \n    PLAN = {'by': 'proposer-agent', 'claim': 'test', 'test': 'test.py', 'decision_rule': 'test'}\n    e1 = R.make_entry([], 'plan', PLAN, now='2024-01-01T00:00:00Z')\n    e2 = R.make_entry([(e1, hashlib.sha256(R.canonical(e1)).hexdigest())], 'plan', PLAN, now='2024-01-01T00:00:00Z')\n    \n    chain = [(e1, hashlib.sha256(R.canonical(e1)).hexdigest()), (e2, hashlib.sha256(R.canonical(e2)).hexdigest())]\n    \n    open(os.path.join(d, 'entries', '000001.json'), 'wb').write(R.canonical(e1))\n    open(os.path.join(d, 'entries', '000002.json'), 'wb').write(R.canonical(e2))\n    \n    recent_time = int(time.time()) - 2 * 3600  # 2 hours ago\n    bundle = {\n        'verificationMaterial': {\n            'tlogEntries': [{'integratedTime': recent_time, 'logIndex': 12345}]\n        }\n    }\n    open(os.path.join(d, 'anchors', '000002.sigstore.json'), 'w').write(json.dumps(bundle))\n    open(os.path.join(d, 'anchors', '000002.ots'), 'wb').write(b'dummy')\n    \n    original_check_ots = R.check_ots\n    original_check_sigstore = R.check_sigstore\n    \n    def stub_check_ots(proof, entry_raw, explorers):\n        return None  # pending\n    \n    def stub_check_sigstore(bundle, digest, repo, workflow, ref):\n        pred = R.range_predicate(chain, 1, 2)\n        return recent_time, pred, 'c0ffee'\n    \n    R.check_ots = stub_check_ots\n    R.check_sigstore = stub_check_sigstore\n    \n    try:\n        # With --max-pending-hours 24 - should PASS because sigstore is only 2 hours old\n        rc = R.main(['--ledger', d, 'check-anchors', '--max-pending-hours', '24'])\n        print(f'Pending OTS, sigstore 2h old, --max-pending-hours 24: rc={rc}')\n    finally:\n        R.check_ots = original_check_ots\n        R.check_sigstore = original_check_sigstore\n\nfinally:\n    import shutil\n    shutil.rmtree(d)\n\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra-550b-a55b:free","usage":{"input":5368,"output":790,"cacheRead":21920,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":57,"totalTokens":28078,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0,"totalFromProvider":true}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1794605274983,"responseId":"gen-1794605275-TFwsDc1SpcX8P5hsQ0Nq","rawStopReason":"tool_calls","durationMs":10457,"thinkingLevel":"medium"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call-e02ca347-f9b4-4ed9-8536-ba730bcf757d","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n \"anchors\": [\n  {\n   \"anchor\": \"000002.ots\",\n   \"kind\": \"opentimestamps\",\n   \"existed_by\": \"pending\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"anchor\": \"000002.sigstore.json\",\n   \"kind\": \"sigstore\",\n   \"entries\": \"1-2\",\n   \"existed_by\": \"2026-11-13T19:28:05Z\",\n   \"writer_commit\": \"c0ffee\"\n  }\n ],\n \"entries\": 2,\n \"writer_attested_through\": 2,\n \"writer_runs\": [],\n \"wrong\": [],\n \"could_not_check\": []\n}\nPending OTS, sigstore 2h old, --